<div class="card" style="max-width:520px">
    <div class="card-head">
        <strong>ORD-4182 — Carrier booking rejected</strong>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body">
        <ul class="timeline">
            <li data-kind="danger">
                <span class="timeline-mark"><i class="ri-error-warning-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                <span class="timeline-when">14:52</span>
                <span class="timeline-what">The carrier rejected the booking</span>
                <div class="timeline-body">
                    <p><code>422 postcode_not_served — no delivery to this postcode</code></p>
                    <p>Retried twice, 10 minutes apart. Both attempts returned the same code.</p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li data-kind="warn">
                <span class="timeline-mark"><i class="ri-lock-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                <span class="timeline-when">14:41</span>
                <span class="timeline-what">Held for a person</span>
                <div class="timeline-body">
                    No other carrier on the contract serves the address, so someone has to book one by
                    hand. Assigned to the dispatch queue rather than to a name.
                </div>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="timeline-mark"><i class="ri-price-tag-3-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                <span class="timeline-when">14:38</span>
                <span class="timeline-what">Classified and tagged</span>
                <div class="timeline-body">
                    <div class="chip-set">
                        <span class="chip">Carrier</span>
                        <span class="chip">Postcode</span>
                        <span class="chip">Northwind Retail</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
